' stroke='#8b5cf6' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='570' y='262' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#6d28d9'>social networking site = sosyal ağ sitesi</text><text x='570' y='278' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#5b21b6'>follow = takip etmek | notification = bildirim</text></svg>", 'b4': "<svg viewBox='0 0 760 300' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' font-family='Arial, sans-serif'><rect width='760' height='300' rx='14' fill='#f8fafc'/><text x='380' y='30' text-anchor='middle' font-size='16' font-weight='bold' fill='#1e293b'>SAFE INTERNET USE: DO'S AND DON'TS</text><rect x='20' y='46' width='350' height='240' rx='12' fill='#f0fdf4' stroke='#22c55e' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='20' y='46' width='350' height='38' rx='12' fill='#22c55e'/><text x='195' y='71' text-anchor='middle' font-size='15' font-weight='bold' fill='#ffffff'>✓ DO (YAP)</text><text x='36' y='108' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#15803d'>✓ You should use strong passwords.</text><text x='54' y='124' font-size='11' fill='#166534'>Güçlü şifreler kullanmalısın.</text><text x='36' y='158' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#15803d'>✓ Always log off on shared computers.</text><text x='54' y='174' font-size='11' fill='#166534'>Ortak bilgisayarda her zaman çıkış yap.</text><text x='36' y='208' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#15803d'>✓ Be polite when you comment.</text><text x='54' y='224' font-size='11' fill='#166534'>Yorum yaparken kibar ol.</text><text x='36' y='258' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#15803d'>✓ Take breaks from the screen.</text><text x='54' y='274' font-size='11' fill='#166534'>Ekrana ara ver.</text><rect x='390' y='46' width='350' height='240' rx='12' fill='#fef2f2' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='390' y='46' width='350' height='38' rx='12' fill='#ef4444'/><text x='565' y='71' text-anchor='middle' font-size='15' font-weight='bold' fill='#ffffff'>✗ DON'T (YAPMA)</text><text x='406' y='108' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#b91c1c'>✗ You shouldn't share your password.</text><text x='424' y='124' font-size='11' fill='#991b1b'>Şifreni paylaşmamalısın.</text><text x='406' y='158' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#b91c1c'>✗ Never open attachments from strangers.</text><text x='424' y='174' font-size='11' fill='#991b1b'>Yabancılardan gelen ekleri asla açma.</text><text x='406' y='208' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#b91c1c'>✗ Don't write rude comments.</text><text x='424' y='224' font-size='11' fill='#991b1b'>Kaba yorumlar yazma.</text><text x='406' y='258' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#b91c1c'>✗ Don't spend all day online.</text><text x='424' y='274' font-size='11' fill='#991b1b'>Bütün gününü internette geçirme.</text></svg>", 'b5': "<svg viewBox='0 0 760 310' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' font-family='Arial, sans-serif'><rect width='760' height='310' rx='14' fill='#f8fafc'/><text x='380' y='28' text-anchor='middle' font-size='15' font-weight='bold' fill='#1e293b'>CLASS 8/A SURVEY: WHAT DO YOU OFTEN DO ONLINE? (30 STUDENTS)</text><line x1='60' y1='260' x2='490' y2='260' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='1.5'/><line x1='60' y1='60' x2='60' y2='260' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='1.5'/><line x1='60' y1='193' x2='490' y2='193' stroke='#e2e8f0'/><line x1='60' y1='127' x2='490' y2='127' stroke='#e2e8f0'/><line x1='60' y1='60' x2='490' y2='60' stroke='#e2e8f0'/><text x='52' y='264' text-anchor='end' font-size='11' fill='#475569'>0</text><text x='52' y='197' text-anchor='end' font-size='11' fill='#475569'>10</text><text x='52' y='131' text-anchor='end' font-size='11' fill='#475569'>20</text><text x='52' y='64' text-anchor='end' font-size='11' fill='#475569'>30</text><rect x='80' y='100' width='60' height='160' rx='4' fill='#3b82f6'/><text x='110' y='94' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#1d4ed8'>24</text><text x='110' y='278' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#0f172a'>watch videos</text><rect x='165' y='113' width='60' height='147' rx='4' fill='#22c55e'/><text x='195' y='107' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#15803d'>22</text><text x='195' y='278' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#0f172a'>chat</text><rect x='250' y='127' width='60' height='133' rx='4' fill='#8b5cf6'/><text x='280' y='121' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#6d28d9'>20</text><text x='280' y='278' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#0f172a'>do research</text><rect x='335' y='153' width='60' height='107' rx='4' fill='#f59e0b'/><text x='365' y='147' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#b45309'>16</text><text x='365' y='278' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#0f172a'>play games</text><rect x='420' y='220' width='60' height='40' rx='4' fill='#ef4444'/><text x='450' y='214' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#b91c1c'>6</text><text x='450' y='278' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#0f172a'>read news</text><text x='275' y='298' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#475569'>number of students (öğrenci sayısı)</text><rect x='510' y='50' width='230' height='110' rx='12' fill='#eff6ff' stroke='#3b82f6' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='625' y='72' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#1d4ed8'>MAIN IDEA (ana fikir)</text><text x='625' y='94' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#1e3a8a'>Most students use the</text><text x='625' y='110' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#1e3a8a'>Internet for fun and</text><text x='625' y='126' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#1e3a8a'>communication.</text><text x='625' y='148' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#475569'>skimming = göz gezdirme</text><rect x='510' y='172' width='230' height='118' rx='12' fill='#fef3c7' stroke='#f59e0b' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='625' y='194' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#b45309'>SPECIFIC INFO (ayrıntı)</text><text x='625' y='216' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#92400e'>most popular: watch videos (24)</text><text x='625' y='234' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#92400e'>least popular: read news (6)</text><text x='625' y='252' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#92400e'>play games: 16 (more than half)</text><text x='625' y='276' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#475569'>scanning = tarama</text></svg>", 'b6': "<svg viewBox='0 0 760 320' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' font-family='Arial, sans-serif'><rect width='760' height='320' rx='14' fill='#f8fafc'/><text x='380' y='30' text-anchor='middle' font-size='16' font-weight='bold' fill='#1e293b'>PARAGRAPH STRUCTURE: MY INTERNET HABITS</text><rect x='20' y='48' width='450' height='60' rx='12' fill='#eff6ff' stroke='#3b82f6' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='245' y='70' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#1d4ed8'>1. TOPIC SENTENCE (konu cümlesi)</text><text x='245' y='92' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#1e3a8a'>The Internet is an important part of my daily life.</text><rect x='20' y='118' width='450' height='120' rx='12' fill='#f0fdf4' stroke='#22c55e' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='245' y='140' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#15803d'>2. SUPPORTING SENTENCES (destekleyici cümleler)</text><text x='36' y='164' font-size='11' fill='#166534'>• When / How often: I usually go online after school.</text><text x='36' y='184' font-size='11' fill='#166534'>• How much time: I spend about two hours a day online.</text><text x='36' y='204' font-size='11' fill='#166534'>• What for: I use a search engine for my projects.</text><text x='36' y='224' font-size='11' fill='#166534'>• Rules: I never share my password because it isn't safe.</text><rect x='20' y='248' width='450' height='60' rx='12' fill='#fef3c7' stroke='#f59e0b' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='245' y='270' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#b45309'>3. CONCLUDING SENTENCE (sonuç cümlesi)</text><text x='245' y='292' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#92400e'>In short, I use the Internet a lot, but I use it carefully.</text><rect x='490' y='48' width='250' height='260' rx='12' fill='#f5f3ff' stroke='#8b5cf6' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='615' y='72' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#6d28d9'>LINKING WORDS</text><text x='615' y='88' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#5b21b6'>(bağlaçlar)</text><text x='510' y='118' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#4c1d95'>and</text><text x='600' y='118' font-size='11' fill='#5b21b6'>ve (ekleme)</text><text x='510' y='146' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#4c1d95'>also</text><text x='600' y='146' font-size='11' fill='#5b21b6'>ayrıca</text><text x='510' y='174' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#4c1d95'>but</text><text x='600' y='174' font-size='11' fill='#5b21b6'>ama (zıtlık)</text><text x='510' y='202' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#4c1d95'>because</text><text x='600' y='202' font-size='11' fill='#5b21b6'>çünkü (sebep)</text><text x='510' y='230' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#4c1d95'>so</text><text x='600' y='230' font-size='11' fill='#5b21b6'>bu yüzden (sonuç)</text><text x='510' y='258' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#4c1d95'>first / then</text><text x='600' y='258' font-size='11' fill='#5b21b6'>önce / sonra</text><text x='510' y='286' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#4c1d95'>in short</text><text x='600' y='286' font-size='11' fill='#5b21b6'>kısacası</text></svg>"}

def uygula(v):
    for idx, b in enumerate(v.get('bolumler', []), 1):
        svg = GORSELLER.get(f'b{idx}') or GORSELLER.get(str(idx))
        if svg:
            b['gorsel'] = svg
    return v
